            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper presents the results of investigations made at the Laboratory of Environmental Genetics, Medical Genetic Research Center, Russian Academy of Medical Sciences, to search for the markers of genetic predisposition or resistance to a number of occupational diseases (asbestosis, occupational fluorosis, silicosis, dust-induced bronchitis, bronchial asthma).</AbstractText>
